            "1920": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/02-add-url-1920.jpg",
            "1600": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-comparison/02-add-url-1600.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Approved connector \u00b7 top",
          "images": {
            "1440": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/02-add-approved-top-1440.jpg",
            "1920": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/02-add-approved-top-1920.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Approved connector \u00b7 bottom",
          "images": {
            "1440": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/02-add-approved-bottom-1440.jpg",
            "1920": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/02-add-approved-bottom-1920.jpg"
          }
        }
      ],
      "gaps": [
        "The vision uses a broad, tightly grouped dialog. The implementation has a smaller relative width, larger vertical gaps and a scrollbar even at 1600 \u00d7 1000.",
        "The format tabs, numbered syntax-highlighted editor, success strip and horizontal credential controls are replaced by a dropdown, plain textarea, sentence and stacked fields.",
        "The compact execution/environment summary, optional connection name and Review connection footer from the vision are absent from this parsed state."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "connectors",
      "title": "Global connectors",
      "number": "03",
      "intent": "An installation-level library with deliberate catalogue and import layouts.",
      "before": [
        {
          "asset": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/before/02-add-approved.png",
          "label": "Previously: connector selection inside a Brain wizard"
        }
      ],
      "beforeNote": "There was no installation-level Connectors page. This original screenshot shows where approved connectors were selected before.",
      "vision": [
        {
          "asset": "output/imagegen/2026-10-05-management-concepts-01a10b36/03-global-connectors-v2.png",
          "label": "Approved generated concept"
        },
        {
          "asset": "output/imagegen/2026-10-05-management-concepts-01a10b36/03-global-connectors.png",
          "label": "Initial generated variant \u00b7 superseded"
        }
      ],
      "after": [
        {
          "label": "Installation connector library",
          "images": {
            "1440": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/03-connectors-1440.jpg",
            "1920": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/03-connectors-1920.jpg",
            "1600": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-comparison/03-connectors-1600.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Search \u00b7 no matches",
          "images": {
            "1440": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/03-connectors-no-match-1440.jpg",
            "1920": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/03-connectors-no-match-1920.jpg"
          }
        }
      ],
      "gaps": [
        "The vision uses compact catalogue cards beside a prominent import/review/approve panel. The implementation has a wide single card and a distant narrow helper panel.",
        "The colourful icon tiles, transport chips, approval tabs and structured import steps were simplified; the resulting visual hierarchy is substantially weaker.",
        "The concept illustrates six definitions; the real installation has one. No additional definitions were invented for this comparison."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "privacy",
      "title": "Privacy",
      "number": "04",
      "intent": "Compact, stable inline settings with the key sections visible together.",
      "before": [
        {
          "asset": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/before/04-privacy-edit.png",
          "label": "Original retention edit state \u00b7 scrolled page"
        }
      ],
      "vision": [
        {
          "asset": "output/imagegen/2026-10-05-management-concepts-01a10b36/04-privacy.png",
          "label": "Approved generated concept"
        }
      ],
      "after": [
        {
          "label": "Retention edit \u00b7 page auto-scrolled to editor",
          "images": {
            "1440": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/04-privacy-edit-1440.jpg",
            "1920": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/04-privacy-edit-1920.jpg",
            "1600": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-comparison/04-privacy-edit-1600.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Read view \u00b7 top of page",
          "images": {
            "1440": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/04-privacy-view-1440.jpg",
            "1920": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/04-privacy-view-1920.jpg",
            "1600": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-comparison/04-privacy-view-1600.jpg"
          }
        }
      ],
      "gaps": [
        "The vision fits retention, capture, evidence and repository controls into a compact viewport. The implementation uses much taller sections; later settings fall below the fold.",
        "Capture remains summary prose rather than the pictured switches. Retention follows Capture, and evidence is expanded into several separate rows.",
        "Inline inputs now exist, but section rhythm, compact units, notice placement and action styling differ. Opening retention also scrolls the current page away from its heading."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-permissions",
      "title": "AI permissions",
      "number": "05",
      "intent": "A clear permission policy with calm coverage and model information beside it.",
      "before": [
        {
          "asset": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/before/05-ai-permissions.png",
          "label": "Original AI policy + expanded diagnostics"
        }
      ],
      "vision": [
        {
          "asset": "output/imagegen/2026-10-05-management-concepts-01a10b36/05-ai-permissions-v2.png",
          "label": "Approved generated concept"
        },
        {
          "asset": "output/imagegen/2026-10-05-management-concepts-01a10b36/05-ai-permissions.png",
          "label": "Initial generated variant \u00b7 superseded"
        }
      ],
      "after": [
        {
          "label": "Policy + search coverage",
          "images": {
            "1440": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/05-ai-1440.jpg",
            "1920": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/05-ai-1920.jpg",
            "1600": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-comparison/05-ai-1600.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Expanded model diagnostics",
          "images": {
            "1440": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/05-ai-diagnostics-1440.jpg",
            "1920": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/05-ai-diagnostics-1920.jpg"
          }
        }
      ],
      "gaps": [
        "The broad two-column structure is present, but the provider identity row and prominent Automatic memory strip from the vision are missing from the policy card.",
        "Permission helpers sit beside labels rather than beneath them, compressing the hierarchy. Allowed-content chips use three columns instead of two.",
        "The vision separates Search coverage, Installed models and More options. The implementation combines provider/models with a single diagnostics link and adds a large amber warning. Counts differ because these are real captures taken at different times."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "agents",
      "title": "Agents",
      "number": "06",
      "intent": "A legible roster and two focused companion cards, with useful visual weight.",
      "before": [
        {
          "asset": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/before/06-agents.png",
          "label": "Original attached Agents screenshot \u00b7 content only"
        }
      ],
      "vision": [
        {
          "asset": "output/imagegen/2026-10-05-management-concepts-01a10b36/06-agents.png",
          "label": "Approved generated concept"
        }
      ],
      "after": [
        {
          "label": "Observed roster + setup + memory check",
          "images": {
            "1440": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/06-agents-1440.jpg",
            "1920": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-final/06-agents-1920.jpg",
            "1600": "output/ui-review/2026-10-05-management/after-comparison/06-agents-1600.jpg"
          }
        }
      ],
      "gaps": [
        "The roster and two companion cards exist, but names, icons and status pills have much less contrast and visual weight than the vision.",
        "The concept has an owner avatar, recognisable host tiles, compact observed dates and a roster footer action. The implementation uses generic tiles, full timestamps and a separate My agents link.",
        "The setup card is instruction-heavy and uses disclosures and a full-width copy action. It does not reproduce the concise command surface and small setup link shown in the concept."
      ]
    }
  ],
